<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Automation on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/automation/</link><description>Recent content in Automation on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/automation/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>11x</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/11x-ai/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/11x-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Adobe Firefly AI Assistant</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/adobe-firefly-ai-assistant/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/adobe-firefly-ai-assistant/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The assistant started as Project Moonlight and launched as Firefly AI Assistant in April 2026. You describe the result you want, and it works through the right apps in order. It draws on Firefly credits, and Adobe has not said how it will price the feature separately. Adobe says it is exploring support for third-party models.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Amazon Bedrock AgentCore</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/amazon-bedrock-agentcore/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/amazon-bedrock-agentcore/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;AgentCore sits under AWS&amp;rsquo;s agent offerings and works with models on Bedrock or elsewhere. Recent additions include episodic memory, which lets an agent recall earlier sessions, and a Policy feature in preview that sets limits on what an agent can do. It is priced on usage.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Azure AI Foundry</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/azure-ai-foundry/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/azure-ai-foundry/</guid><description/></item><item><title>BabyAGI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/babyagi/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/babyagi/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Bardeen</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/bardeen/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/bardeen/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Baserow</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/baserow/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/baserow/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Boomi</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/boomi/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/boomi/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Claude Cowork</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/claude-cowork/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/claude-cowork/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Cowork takes the agent approach behind Claude Code and puts it in a regular app window. Instead of typing commands, you describe a job such as sorting a folder of receipts, turning notes into a report, or building a spreadsheet from several PDFs. Claude plans the steps, works on the files you have shared with it, and reports back when it is done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is aimed at office work more than software projects. You choose which folders it can see, so it only touches what you hand over. It suits repetitive jobs where you would otherwise copy and paste between documents all afternoon.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Databricks Agent Bricks</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/databricks-agent-bricks/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/databricks-agent-bricks/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Agent Bricks is the center of Databricks&amp;rsquo; agent push. Teams describe the task, and the platform helps generate test data, pick models and measure quality. Databricks reports Lakebase passed $100 million in run-rate revenue within months of general availability.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Figma Weave</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/figma-weave/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/figma-weave/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;During the open beta the tools use no AI credits and are limited to Professional plans and higher with Full seats. Figma says deeper integration between Figma and Weave arrives later in 2026.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Gemini Spark</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/gemini-spark/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/gemini-spark/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Spark runs in the background and handles longer jobs, such as pulling together information from your inbox and documents or following up on a task over several days. Google says it works with Gmail and Docs first, and that outside tools will connect through MCP later.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At launch it was limited to US subscribers on the Google AI Ultra plan. Android is expected to show an agent&amp;rsquo;s progress at the top of the screen later in the year.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>GitHub Agent HQ</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/github-agent-hq/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/github-agent-hq/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Agent HQ was announced at GitHub Universe in October 2025 and released more widely in early 2026. OpenAI&amp;rsquo;s Codex was the first outside agent supported, followed by Claude Code. Admins choose which agents and models their teams may use, and a metrics dashboard shows usage. Plan Mode lets an agent propose steps before it writes code.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>IBM Bob</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/ibm-bob/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/ibm-bob/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Bob was announced at IBM Think in May 2026 alongside the next-generation watsonx Orchestrate. IBM positions it for companies that need governance around coding agents and work with older systems.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>LangGraph</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/langgraph/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/langgraph/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Microsoft Copilot Studio</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/microsoft-copilot-studio/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/microsoft-copilot-studio/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Mistral Vibe</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/mistral-vibe/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/mistral-vibe/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Mistral released Vibe in May 2026 as an agent that can take on coding and office tasks. It runs on Mistral&amp;rsquo;s own models, which companies can also deploy on their own infrastructure, setting it apart from agents tied to US cloud providers.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>NemoClaw</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/nemoclaw/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/nemoclaw/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;NemoClaw was announced at GTC 2026 as NVIDIA&amp;rsquo;s answer to enterprise concerns about agents acting on their own. It starts from the open-source OpenClaw agent and adds sandboxing and policy controls so companies can decide what an agent is allowed to touch. It is designed to work with Nemotron models but is not tied to them.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>NocoDB</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/nocodb/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/nocodb/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Notion Custom Agents</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/notion-custom-agents/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/notion-custom-agents/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Custom Agents were free to try until May 3, 2026 and now run on Notion credits, available as an add-on on Business and Enterprise plans. Admins control who can create agents and which models they use. Notion 3.6 added External Agents in July 2026.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Perplexity Computer</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/perplexity-computer/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/perplexity-computer/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Computer runs in the cloud, so tasks can continue while you are away. Perplexity pairs it with Comet, its browser, as part of an effort to become a daily starting point rather than a search box. Pricing sits behind Perplexity&amp;rsquo;s paid plans.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Replit Agent 4</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/replit-agent-4/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/replit-agent-4/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Agent 4 launched in March 2026 with Replit&amp;rsquo;s $400 million Series D. It reached iPhone in May after a long App Store review dispute. You describe what you want, and the agent builds and deploys it from the browser.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Salesforce Agentforce</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/salesforce-agentforce/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/salesforce-agentforce/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Agentforce lets companies run agents for sales, service and marketing against their own Salesforce data. Piper, an inbound pipeline agent, is generally available, and Hunter, for outbound sales, follows in November 2026. Agentforce Coworker, aimed at employees, passed 100,000 users in 35 days by Salesforce&amp;rsquo;s count.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>SAP Joule</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/sap-joule/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/sap-joule/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Joule answers questions and carries out tasks inside SAP applications. Joule Studio 2.0 lets customers and partners build agents, with first availability from June 2026. SAP also set up a partner fund of about 100 million euros.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>SAP Signavio</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/sap-signavio/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/sap-signavio/</guid><description/></item><item><title>ServiceNow Otto</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/servicenow-otto/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/servicenow-otto/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Otto sits alongside Action Fabric and expanded AI Control Tower governance. It is aimed at employees and IT teams that already run workflows on ServiceNow.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Slackbot</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/slackbot/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/slackbot/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Slackbot can search channels, draft content, schedule meetings and take actions in Slack, and it can hand work to Agentforce agents. It is included in Business+ and Enterprise+ plans, with a limited version on free and Pro plans from April 2026.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Stripe Agentic Commerce Suite</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/stripe-agentic-commerce-suite/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/stripe-agentic-commerce-suite/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Merchants can accept purchases made by AI agents, and agents can get virtual cards or settle in USDC through x402. Real agent spending is still small, according to industry reporting.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>SuperAGI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/superagi/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/superagi/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Twilio ConversationRelay</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/twilio-conversationrelay/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/twilio-conversationrelay/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;It went generally available in May 2025. In May 2026 Twilio released Conversation Relay Insights, which reports latency, interruptions and handling time so teams can see where agents struggle.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Zapier MCP</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/zapier-mcp/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/zapier-mcp/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Zapier adopted MCP in September 2025. After setup, an AI assistant can call Zapier actions in apps like Gmail, Slack and Sheets. Coverage cites between 8,000 and more than 9,000 apps depending on the date.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>awesome-openclaw-skills</title><link>https://bestofai.io/skills/voltagent-awesome-openclaw-skills/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/skills/voltagent-awesome-openclaw-skills/</guid><description/></item><item><title>beacon.sh</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/beacon-sh/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/beacon-sh/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Cedric</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/cedric/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/cedric/</guid><description/></item><item><title>ClawsGO Science</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/clawsgo-science/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/clawsgo-science/</guid><description/></item><item><title>UnleashX</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/unleashx/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/unleashx/</guid><description/></item><item><title>DeepSeek Super-Agent</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/deepseek-super-agent/</link><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/deepseek-super-agent/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Herdr</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/herdr/</link><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/herdr/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Claude Duet</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/claude-duet/</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/claude-duet/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Conduyt</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/conduyt/</link><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/conduyt/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Celonis</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/celonis/</link><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/celonis/</guid><description/></item><item><title>OpenAI Dots</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/openai-dots/</link><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/openai-dots/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Grok Bot</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/grok-bot/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/grok-bot/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Sider Omni Sidebar</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/sider-omni-sidebar/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/sider-omni-sidebar/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Meta Muse</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/meta-muse/</link><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/meta-muse/</guid><description/></item><item><title>MagiCrew</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/magicrew/</link><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/magicrew/</guid><description/></item><item><title>ChatGPT Atlas</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/chatgpt-atlas/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/chatgpt-atlas/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Viktor</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/viktor-ai/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/viktor-ai/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Viktor is an AI agent from Zeta Labs that lives inside Slack and Microsoft Teams instead of a standalone interface. It connects to a company&amp;rsquo;s existing tools, learns the patterns of how a team works over time, and steps in with suggestions or completed work such as campaign drafts, internal apps, and reports, without waiting for someone to open a separate app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zeta Labs, the team behind the earlier AI email assistant Jace, launched Viktor on Slack first and expanded it to Microsoft Teams in mid-2026. The company says tens of thousands of teams have adopted it, and it has raised a $75 million Series A led by Accel. Viktor targets teams that want an AI agent that acts inside the channels where work already happens rather than one more tool to switch into.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Comet</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/perplexity-comet/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/perplexity-comet/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Genspark</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/genspark/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/genspark/</guid><description/></item><item><title>OpenAI Presence</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/openai-presence/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/openai-presence/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Baidu Qianfan</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/baidu-qianfan/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/baidu-qianfan/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Cohere North</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/cohere-north/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/cohere-north/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Palantir AIP</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/palantir-aip/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/palantir-aip/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Tencent Cloud ADP</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/tencent-cloud-adp/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/tencent-cloud-adp/</guid><description/></item><item><title>ChatGPT Work</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/chatgpt-work/</link><pu